Hi all,

Just thought I would post with a solution I have found to my own problem.

I was getting an error: C stack size is too small (I think from R) in my shell, so I told my shell (bash) ulimit -s unlimited, which makes the C stack size unlimited, and that fixed the problem, so I can use R-2.7 with rpy and Apache2/mod_python/Django.

-----Original Message-----
