I'm inclined to think that it is NOT an inherent incompatibility problem with mod_python and RPy since I have a working Rpy/apache/mod_python system on top of Django. Relevant package versions for the working system are:

Django-rev7716
Apache-2.0.55-4ubuntu2.3
mod_python-3.1.4-0ubuntu1.1
R-2.2.1
RPy-rev563

But when I switch to R-2.7 and Python 2.5, I start getting the error (RPy_Exception: R Function "get" not found). Furthermore, this error happens on the Django development webserver as well, so it must be an error independent of apache/mod_python.

Any thoughts?

